flowchart TB
    U[Internet users] --> ALB[Application Load Balancer<br/>Public subnets]
    subgraph VPC[Amazon VPC 10.0.0.0/16]
      subgraph PUB[Public subnets - AZ A and AZ B]
        ALB
        IGW[Internet Gateway]
        NAT[NAT Gateway]
      end
      subgraph APP[Private application subnets]
        EC2[EC2 web application<br/>No public IP]
      end
      subgraph DB[Private database subnets]
        RDS[(Amazon RDS MySQL<br/>Public access disabled)]
      end
      ALB -->|HTTP 80, ALB SG to App SG| EC2
      EC2 -->|MySQL 3306, App SG to DB SG| RDS
      EC2 -->|Outbound updates| NAT
      NAT --> IGW
    end
    VPC --> FLOW[VPC Flow Logs -> CloudWatch Logs]
    CT[CloudTrail] --> S3[Private S3 bucket]
